{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_1A96AD25","title":"Odd Behavior","entry":"Dlg_1A96AD25::entry","exit":"Dlg_1A96AD25::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_08AFF9A6","articyId":"72057697117149887","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That was an interesting conversation with Kai.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That was an interesting conversation with Kai.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":250.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18857","byteOffset":15021304,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_158E95EF","articyId":"72057697117149915","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'm aware. I know your schedule before you do.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm aware. I know your schedule before you do.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":875.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18821","byteOffset":15007328,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_BC30AED4","articyId":"72057697117149946","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'm not exactly speaking to you out of the need for human connection. Well, I guess in a tertiary way I am, but that's for the unemployed philosophers to figure out.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not exactly speaking to you out of the need for human connection. Well, I guess in a tertiary way I am, but that's for the unemployed philosophers to figure out.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31644","byteOffset":19852520,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_2929B4A4","articyId":"72057697117149968","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I just pulled up the studio his loudcaster license is through. They were replaying an episode of his pre-dawn talk show.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I just pulled up the studio his loudcaster license is through. They were replaying an episode of his pre-dawn talk show.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2075.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18366","byteOffset":14836152,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_FB5988F6","articyId":"72057697117149983","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Oh, sure. And for a variety of reasons too. However it looks like Kai never showed up for work. Didn't notify them, nothing.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, sure. And for a variety of reasons too. However it looks like Kai never showed up for work. Didn't notify them, nothing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2675.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25363","byteOffset":17480320,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_7368BAA1","articyId":"72057697117150032","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Well, I know your schedule's tight and all that but maybe he'd benefit from a visit?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I know your schedule's tight and all that but maybe he'd benefit from a visit?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50870","byteOffset":33584192,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_18973628","articyId":"72057697117150061","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He usually posts from this cafe after his show wraps up. Maybe he's there?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He usually posts from this cafe after his show wraps up. Maybe he's there?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43703","byteOffset":30863416,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_17211B4B","articyId":"72057697117150076","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I think that's for the best. I'll mark the location of the cafe for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think that's for the best. I'll mark the location of the cafe for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31816","byteOffset":19916344,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_497143E0","articyId":"72057697117149899","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't really have time for this right now.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't really have time for this right now.","TextSheVersion":"I don't really have time for this right now.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't really have time for this right now."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":575.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34359","byteOffset":20881672,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_E27AE38A","articyId":"72057697117149904","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What about Kai?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What about Kai?","TextSheVersion":"What about Kai?","TextTheyVersion":"What about Kai?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50341","byteOffset":33385640,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_2A2A4487","articyId":"72057697117149922","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And this is important enough to interrupt it?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And this is important enough to interrupt it?","TextSheVersion":"And this is important enough to interrupt it?","TextTheyVersion":"And this is important enough to interrupt it?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1175.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44806","byteOffset":31285056,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_C455C2ED","articyId":"72057697117149975","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm sure they do that all the time.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm sure they do that all the time.","TextSheVersion":"I'm sure they do that all the time.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm sure they do that all the time."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41432","byteOffset":30002424,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_672CA2AA","articyId":"72057697117149990","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Right, what do you think we should do?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right, what do you think we should do?","TextSheVersion":"Right, what do you think we should do?","TextTheyVersion":"Right, what do you think we should do?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26724","byteOffset":17988864,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_2C2427BC","articyId":"72057697117150045","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I wouldn't even know where to find him.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I wouldn't even know where to find him.","TextSheVersion":"I wouldn't even know where to find him.","TextTheyVersion":"I wouldn't even know where to find him."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19741","byteOffset":15351648,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_D68C9486","articyId":"72057697117150068","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright, why not.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright, why not.","TextSheVersion":"Alright, why not.","TextTheyVersion":"Alright, why not."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24753","byteOffset":17244248,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_4471C15A","articyId":"72057821671325588","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Then what's so important?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Then what's so important?","TextSheVersion":"Then what's so important?","TextTheyVersion":"Then what's so important?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44555","byteOffset":31186232,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_8E1C2BDF","articyId":"72057821671325596","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragmen